{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JpTZT3R6AqBHMBCtrDwose","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: median\n2\tnarrative_guidance: 'Median档下论文核心叙事：function-level null result跨seed稳健复现，classification与CWM在简单任务上统计不可分；\n3\t  repo-level出现方向性优势（2-5pp）但置信区间宽，CWM在repo-level暴露5-14%不可解析/截断率； diagnostic re-repair呈方向性改善但未达显著性阈值。论文重心转向Claim\n4\t  1（efficiency-equivalent + complexity-dependent advantage假说） 和Claim 3（oracle frontier\n5\t  characterization）的组合贡献，Claim 2降格为\"motivated hypothesis with directional evidence\"。\n6\t  目标EMNLP Findings，Main需要强rebuttal prep。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Multi-Seed Core Validation\n11\t  plan_id: multi-seed-core\n12\t  description: Classification和CWM各跑seeds {0, 1, 42}，报告mean±std F1，paired bootstrap\n13\t    CI\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    cls_pass_f1_mean: 87.0\n16\t    cls_pass_f1_std: 0.45\n17\t    cls_fail_f1_mean: 87.8\n18\t    cls_fail_f1_std: 0.52\n19\t    cwm_pass_f1_mean: 87.2\n20\t    cwm_pass_f1_std: 0.61\n21\t    cwm_fail_f1_mean: 87.6\n22\t    cwm_fail_f1_std: 0.58\n23\t    mean_f1_diff_cls_minus_cwm: -0.1\n24\t    paired_bootstrap_95ci:\n25\t    - -0.9\n26\t    - 0.7\n27\t    p_value_paired_test: 0.72\n28\t    significant_at_005: false\n29\t  result_rationale: 'Seed 42的已有结果（CLS 87.1/87.9 vs CWM 87.31/87.71）已示null result。\n30\t    Median档下function-level diff在[-0.5, 0.5]pp范围，multi-seed std在0.3-1.0。 4B LoRA在HumanEval/MBPP这类简单function-level数据上variance主要来自LoRA初始化和数据shuffle顺序，\n31\t    因为task本身较简单（短执行输出，binary label明确），不同seed间波动有限但非零。 CWM的std略高于CLS因为generation任务对初始化更敏感（需要学习exact\n32\t    string matching而非binary boundary）。 Bootstrap CI跨零说明无法拒绝H0，正式确认function-level null\n33\t    result。\n34\t\n35\t    '\n36\t  tables:\n37\t  - name: 'Table 2: Multi-Seed Function-Level Results'\n38\t    columns:\n39\t    - Model\n40\t    - Seed\n41\t    - Pass F1\n42\t    - Fail F1\n43\t    - Overall Acc\n44\t    rows:\n45\t    - - CLS\n46\t      - '0'\n47\t      - '86.5'\n48\t      - '87.3'\n49\t      - '86.9'\n50\t    - - CLS\n51\t      - '1'\n52\t      - '87.4'\n53\t      - '88.2'\n54\t      - '87.8'\n55\t    - - CLS\n56\t      - '42'\n57\t      - '87.1'\n58\t      - '87.9'\n59\t      - '87.5'\n60\t    - - CLS\n61\t      - Mean±Std\n62\t      - 87.0±0.45\n63\t      - 87.8±0.52\n64\t      - 87.4±0.46\n65\t    - - CWM\n66\t      - '0'\n67\t      - '87.8'\n68\t      - '88.1'\n69\t      - '87.9'\n70\t    - - CWM\n71\t      - '1'\n72\t      - '86.6'\n73\t      - '87.0'\n74\t      - '86.8'\n75\t    - - CWM\n76\t      - '42'\n77\t      - '87.3'\n78\t      - '87.7'\n79\t      - '87.5'\n80\t    - - CWM\n81\t      - Mean±Std\n82\t      - 87.2±0.61\n83\t      - 87.6±0.58\n84\t      - 87.4±0.56\n85\t  figures_description:\n86\t  - paired bootstrap差值分布直方图，95%CI跨零，标注p=0.72\n87\t  analysis: 'Null result跨三个seed稳健复现。两种formulation在function-level统计不可分（p=0.72）， CI覆盖零。这确认function-level\n88\t    task的简单性使得classification和generation等价—— 短执行输出不触发CWM failure modes。该结果为complexity-dependent\n89\t    advantage叙事提供必要的baseline锚点。 CWM略高std符合预期：generation target空间更大，对随机初始化更敏感。\n90\t\n91\t    '\n92\t- name: Trace-then-Judge Ablation\n93\t  plan_id: trace-then-judge\n94\t  description: 单模型先生成~50 token执行推理trace再输出pass/fail，测试显式推理是否有帮助\n95\t  expected_results:\n96\t    ttj_pass_f1: 87.5\n97\t    ttj_fail_f1: 88.1\n98\t    ttj_overall_acc: 87.8\n99\t    ttj_vs_direct_cls_f1_diff: 0.15\n100\t    ttj_unparseable_pct: 1.2\n101\t    ttj_avg_output_tokens: 58\n102\t    ttj_training_loss: 0.271\n103\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下trace-then-judge与direct CLS的diff在[-2, 2]pp范围。在function-level上，\n104\t    pass/fail判断所需的\"推理\"本质上很浅——输入代码通常<50行，test assertion直接明了。 额外的reasoning trace更多是\"复述\"而非\"深度推理\"，对4B模型而言增加了学习负担但也提供了\n105\t    中间监督信号，两个效应大致抵消。结果略微正向（+0.15pp）但远不显著，说明在simple tasks上 显式推理既不帮助也不伤害。1.2%的unparseable来自偶尔的trace过长导致pass/fail\n106\t    token被截断。 该结果支持论文论点：classification的优势不是来自\"跳过推理\"而是来自\"避免output complexity\"。\n107\t\n108\t    '\n109\t  tables:\n110\t  - name: 'Table 3: Trace-then-Judge Ablation'\n111\t    columns:\n112\t    - Model\n113\t    - Pass F1\n114\t    - Fail F1\n115\t    - Acc\n116\t    - Unparseable%\n117\t    rows:\n118\t    - - Direct CLS\n119\t      - '87.0'\n120\t      - '87.8'\n121\t      - '87.4'\n122\t      - '0.0'\n123\t    - - Trace-then-Judge\n124\t      - '87.5'\n125\t      - '88.1'\n126\t      - '87.8'\n127\t      - '1.2'\n128\t    - - CWM (generation)\n129\t      - '87.2'\n130\t      - '87.6'\n131\t      - '87.4'\n132\t      - '0.0'\n133\t  figures_description:\n134\t  - 三种formulation（direct CLS / trace-then-judge / CWM）的F1 bar chart with error bars\n135\t  analysis: 'Trace-then-judge与direct CLS差异微乎其微（+0.15pp），且低于multi-seed variance。 这排除了\"classification优势来自跳过执行推理\"的反驳——即使显式添加reasoning\n136\t    trace也不改变结果。 真正的区分因素是output format complexity（binary vs full string），不是reasoning\n137\t    depth。 1.2% unparseable率虽小但预示了repo-level上chain-of-thought+判断管线可能面临的格式问题。\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t- name: Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\n141\t  plan_id: traj-level-finetuned\n142\t  description: Qwen3-4B LoRA训练trajectory-level resolved/unresolved预测，隔离granularity效应\n143\t  expected_results:\n144\t    traj_accuracy: 83.2\n145\t    traj_resolved_f1: 82.8\n146\t    traj_unresolved_f1: 83.5\n147\t    traj_vs_pertest_cls_acc_gap: 4.2\n148\t    instances_evaluated: 1890\n149\t    training_loss: 0.312\n150\t  result_rationale: 'Trajectory-level任务将所有test concatenate成单个输入，要求模型判断\"整体是否resolved\"。\n151\t    这比per-test classification更难：(1) 输入更长（多个test拼接），注意力被稀释； (2) resolved需要ALL tests\n152\t    pass，unresolved只需ANY test fail——正负类的判断逻辑不对称； (3) 数据量不变但每个problem_id只产生1个训练样本（vs\n153\t    per-test产生T个），有效训练集缩小。 Median档下4.2pp的gap合理——trajectory-level不是catastrophically差但明显弱于per-test。\n154\t    这为Claim 2的granularity论点提供function-level证据（per-test > trajectory）， 但因为这是function-level数据，gap主要来自信息论优势而非complexity\n155\t    advantage。\n156\t\n157\t    '\n158\t  tables:\n159\t  - name: 'Table 4: Granularity Comparison (Function-Level)'\n160\t    columns:\n161\t    - Granularity\n162\t    - Accuracy\n163\t    - Positive F1\n164\t    - Negative F1\n165\t    rows:\n166\t    - - Per-test CLS\n167\t      - '87.4'\n168\t      - '87.0'\n169\t      - '87.8'\n170\t    - - Trajectory-level\n171\t      - '83.2'\n172\t      - '82.8'\n173\t      - '83.5'\n174\t    - - Δ\n175\t      - '+4.2'\n176\t      - '+4.2'\n177\t      - '+4.3'\n178\t  figures_description:\n179\t  - per-test vs trajectory-level accuracy随instance test数量T的变化曲线\n180\t  analysis: 'Per-test classification比trajectory-level高4.2pp，确认粒度细化本身有价值。 但需注意这个gap部分来自有效训练样本量差异（per-test产生~6x更多样本），\n181\t    不完全是granularity的信息论优势。论文需要honest reporting这一confound。 该结果为diagnostic signal叙事提供support——per-test\n182\t    predictions的精度高于trajectory-level。\n183\t\n184\t    '\n185\t- name: Model Size Scaling (4B→8B)\n186\t  plan_id: model-size-scaling\n187\t  description: CLS和CWM各从4B扩展到8B，测试classification advantage是否跨scale成立\n188\t  expected_results:\n189\t    cls_8b_pass_f1: 89.2\n190\t    cls_8b_fail_f1: 90.0\n191\t    cls_8b_acc: 89.6\n192\t    cwm_8b_pass_f1: 89.0\n193\t    cwm_8b_fail_f1: 89.8\n194\t    cwm_8b_acc: 89.4\n195\t    cls_4b_to_8b_gain: 2.2\n196\t    cwm_4b_to_8b_gain: 2.0\n197\t    cls_vs_cwm_8b_diff: 0.2\n198\t    cwm_8b_unparseable: 0\n199\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下function-level的CLS vs CWM diff在[-0.5, 0.5]。8B模型在function-level上\n200\t    两种formulation都有~2pp提升（更大模型更好地理解code semantics），但diff依然近零（0.2pp）。 这是因为function-level的execution\n201\t    output足够短（<50 tokens），8B CWM有更多capacity 来精确匹配输出字符串。Null result在8B上持续成立，进一步支持\"advantage\n202\t    is complexity-dependent not scale-dependent\"。CWM 8B unparseable仍为0因为function-level输出格式简单。\n203\t    这个结果关键在于排除\"classification只在小模型上好\"的反驳。\n204\t\n205\t    '\n206\t  tables:\n207\t  - name: 'Table 5: Model Scale Comparison'\n208\t    columns:\n209\t    - Model\n210\t    - Size\n211\t    - Pass F1\n212\t    - Fail F1\n213\t    - Acc\n214\t    - Δ vs CLS\n215\t    rows:\n216\t    - - CLS\n217\t      - 4B\n218\t      - '87.0'\n219\t      - '87.8'\n220\t      - '87.4'\n221\t      - —\n222\t    - - CWM\n223\t      - 4B\n224\t      - '87.2'\n225\t      - '87.6'\n226\t      - '87.4'\n227\t      - '-0.0'\n228\t    - - CLS\n229\t      - 8B\n230\t      - '89.2'\n231\t      - '90.0'\n232\t      - '89.6'\n233\t      - —\n234\t    - - CWM\n235\t      - 8B\n236\t      - '89.0'\n237\t      - '89.8'\n238\t      - '89.4'\n239\t      - '-0.2'\n240\t  figures_description:\n241\t  - 4B/8B x CLS/CWM的2x2 F1 line plot，可视化scaling behavior\n242\t  analysis: '两种formulation在function-level上scale equally well（~2pp gain from 4B→8B），\n243\t    diff在8B时仍不显著。结合repo-level实验的预期结果（CLS优势出现）， 可构建\"advantage threshold depends on\n244\t    output complexity not model scale\"的论点。 8B结果也提供了Pareto frontier的additional data\n245\t    points。\n246\t\n247\t    '\n248\t- name: Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\n249\t  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n250\t  description: 对200个instance比较有/无per-test failure信息的repair resolve rate\n251\t  expected_results:\n252\t    baseline_resolve_rate: 31.5\n253\t    with_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 33.0\n254\t    resolve_rate_gain_pp: 1.5\n255\t    n_instances: 200\n256\t    p_value_mcnemar: 0.18\n257\t    significant_at_005: false\n258\t    instances_where_diagnostic_helped: 12\n259\t    instances_where_diagnostic_hurt: 9\n260\t    net_helped: 3\n261\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下re-repair gain在[0.5, 3]pp，方向正确但不显著。原因： (1) Per-test predictions本身有~13%错误率，错误的diagnostic\n262\t    signal可能误导repair agent； (2) 200 instances样本量下1.5pp差异的statistical power很低（需要~800+\n263\t    instances达80% power）； (3) function-level训练的verifier对repo-level数据的transfer有gap，\n264\t    diagnostic signal质量比oracle scenario差很多； (4) repair agent（SWE-agent类）本身的stochasticity也增加noise。\n265\t    net_helped仅3个instance（12帮助-9伤害），说明diagnostic signal的precision不够高 导致部分case被误导。这支持将Claim\n266\t    2降格为hypothesis。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t  tables:\n270\t  - name: 'Table 6: Diagnostic Re-repair Results'\n271\t    columns:\n272\t    - Condition\n273\t    - Resolve Rate\n274\t    - 95% CI\n275\t    rows:\n276\t    - - No diagnostic (baseline)\n277\t      - 31.5%\n278\t      - '[25.1, 38.3]'\n279\t    - - With per-test diagnostic\n280\t      - 33.0%\n281\t      - '[26.5, 39.9]'\n282\t    - - Δ\n283\t      - +1.5pp\n284\t      - '[-0.7, 3.7]'\n285\t  figures_description:\n286\t  - 'per-instance paired comparison scatter plot: baseline vs diagnostic-aided resolve'\n287\t  - 帮助/伤害/无影响的instance breakdown bar chart\n288\t  analysis: '方向性正向但p=0.18远不达显著。CI覆盖零。在median档下这是预期结果—— diagnostic signal exists但verifier精度不足以consistently改善downstream\n289\t    repair。 论文应honest报告为\"directional evidence suggesting per-test diagnostics may\n290\t    help targeted re-repair, but our current verifier accuracy is insufficient for\n291\t    statistically significant improvement\"。Claim 2降格为motivated hypothesis。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t- name: Per-Test Precision-Recall Analysis\n295\t  plan_id: per-test-precision-recall\n296\t  description: 在完整测试集上测量per-test failure prediction的precision/recall\n297\t  expected_results:\n298\t    fail_precision: 0.876\n299\t    fail_recall: 0.882\n300\t    pass_precision: 0.874\n301\t    pass_recall: 0.868\n302\t    macro_f1: 0.875\n303\t    per_problem_fail_precision_std: 0.12\n304\t    per_problem_fail_recall_std: 0.14\n305\t    hard_subset_fail_f1: 0.78\n306\t    easy_subset_fail_f1: 0.93\n307\t  result_rationale: '这些指标直接来自mvp-b-train已有结果（CLS model precision/recall）。 Median档的新增insight在于per-problem\n308\t    variance分析：fail prediction精度在problems间 差异较大（std~0.12-0.14），说明模型在某些problem types上远好于平均，在另一些上远差。\n309\t    Hard subset（多步逻辑/复杂数据结构）的fail F1降至0.78，easy subset达0.93。 这种heterogeneity解释了为什么aggregate精度看似足够（87.6%），但downstream\n310\t    re-repair 效果不显著——恰好是hard cases最需要diagnostic signal，却也是prediction最不可靠的地方。\n311\t\n312\t    '\n313\t  tables:\n314\t  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Test Prediction Quality'\n315\t    columns:\n316\t    - Metric\n317\t    - Overall\n318\t    - Easy Subset\n319\t    - Hard Subset\n320\t    rows:\n321\t    - - Fail Precision\n322\t      - '0.876'\n323\t      - '0.94'\n324\t      - '0.79'\n325\t    - - Fail Recall\n326\t      - '0.882'\n327\t      - '0.92'\n328\t      - '0.77'\n329\t    - - Fail F1\n330\t      - '0.879'\n331\t      - '0.93'\n332\t      - '0.78'\n333\t    - - Pass F1\n334\t      - '0.871'\n335\t      - '0.93'\n336\t      - '0.79'\n337\t  figures_description:\n338\t  - per-problem fail F1分布直方图，标注easy/hard分割\n339\t  - precision-recall curve with operating points标注\n340\t  analysis: 'Aggregate指标掩盖了problem-level heterogeneity。模型在easy cases上precision接近perfect\n341\t    但在hard cases上降至~0.78。这为Claim 3（oracle frontier）提供empirical grounding： per-test\n342\t    advantage在easy cases上不需要（trajectory-level已足够），在hard cases上 又受限于prediction quality。最优operating\n343\t    point取决于difficulty distribution。\n344\t\n345\t    '\n346\t- name: Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\n347\t  plan_id: oracle-f2p-stratified\n348\t  description: 按F2P test数量分层的oracle per-test advantage分析\n349\t  expected_results:\n350\t    T1_pct_instances: 68.7\n351\t    T1_iid_advantage: 0.02\n352\t    T1_block_advantage: 0.109\n353\t    T2_pct_instances: 16.5\n354\t    T2_iid_advantage: 0.185\n355\t    T2_block_advantage: 0.362\n356\t    T3plus_pct_instances: 14.8\n357\t    T3plus_iid_advantage: 0.241\n358\t    T3plus_block_advantage: 0.384\n359\t    weighted_avg_iid_advantage: 0.063\n360\t    weighted_avg_block_advantage: 0.178\n361\t  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench Verified的F2P分布高度右偏（68.7% T=1），T=1时per-test退化为trajectory-level\n362\t    （只有一个test），advantage仅来自于该test的prediction精度差异（near zero under iid， ~11pp under\n363\t    block correlation因为block结构在T=1时等价于instance-level bias）。 T=2时advantage跳增至~18.5pp(iid)/36.2pp(block)，因为两个独立test的joint\n364\t    correct 概率(0.85^2=0.72)远低于trajectory-level的single 0.85，per-test formulation通过\n365\t    分别预测获得的信息增益开始明显。T=3+时advantage继续增长但边际递减。 关键insight：68.7%的instances是T=1，这解释了为什么overall\n366\t    weighted advantage在iid下 仅6.3pp——大部分instances上per-test没有structural advantage。 Block\n367\t    correlation将advantage从6.3pp放大到17.8pp，但这依赖于block假设的empirical validity。\n368\t\n369\t    '\n370\t  tables:\n371\t  - name: 'Table 8: Oracle Per-Test Advantage Stratified by F2P Count'\n372\t    columns:\n373\t    - F2P Count\n374\t    - '% Instances'\n375\t    - IID Adv@(70,85)\n376\t    - Block Adv@(70,85)\n377\t    rows:\n378\t    - - T=1\n379\t      - 68.7%\n380\t      - '0.020'\n381\t      - '0.109'\n382\t    - - T=2\n383\t      - 16.5%\n384\t      - '0.185'\n385\t      - '0.362'\n386\t    - - T=3+\n387\t      - 14.8%\n388\t      - '0.241'\n389\t      - '0.384'\n390\t    - - Weighted Avg\n391\t      - 100%\n392\t      - '0.063'\n393\t      - '0.178'\n394\t  figures_description:\n395\t  - per-test advantage vs T的折线图（iid和block两条线），x轴标注各T的instance占比\n396\t  - SWE-bench Verified F2P count分布直方图\n397\t  analysis: '最强standalone finding之一。清晰展示per-test advantage集中在T≥2的31.3% instances。\n398\t    这为practitioners提供决策框架：\"当你知道task有多个failing tests时deploy per-test verifier， 否则trajectory-level足够。\"Weighted\n399\t    average under iid仅6.3pp说明naive deployment 平均收益有限，但targeted deployment（只在T≥2上用）收益显著。\n400\t    Block correlation的放大效应是论文的一个differentiated contribution—— 但需要block-corr-empirical实验来validate假设强度。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t- name: Block Correlation Empirical Validation\n404\t  plan_id: block-corr-empirical\n405\t  description: 从训练好的模型predictions中测量actual error correlation structure\n406\t  expected_results:\n407\t    measured_intra_instance_corr: 0.18\n408\t    simulated_block_corr_assumed: 0.3\n409\t    iid_corr: 0.0\n410\t    partial_block_fraction: 0.62\n411\t    full_block_fraction: 0.15\n412\t    iid_fraction: 0.23\n413\t    effective_rho: 0.21\n414\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下block correlation假设\"部分确认但effect size小于simulated\"。 Oracle\n415\t    simulation假设完全block correlation（ρ=1 within instance），但实际模型的 error correlation受多种因素调制：(1)\n416\t    同一instance内不同tests测试不同功能时errors 较独立；(2) 但共享的code context理解错误导致correlated failures。\n417\t    实测intra-instance correlation ~0.18，介于iid(0)和full-block(1)之间， closer to iid than\n418\t    simulation assumed。这意味着oracle analysis中block curve 过于乐观——实际advantage介于iid和block曲线之间，但更接近iid端。\n419\t    62% of instances show partial correlation, 15% show full block (all tests同时 对或同时错),\n420\t    23% near iid。这部分支持block假设但削弱了它作为论文主要selling point的force。\n421\t\n422\t    '\n423\t  tables:\n424\t  - name: 'Table 9: Empirical Error Correlation Structure'\n425\t    columns:\n426\t    - Correlation Model\n427\t    - Assumed ρ\n428\t    - Measured ρ\n429\t    - Oracle Adv@(70,85)\n430\t    rows:\n431\t    - - IID\n432\t      - '0.0'\n433\t      - —\n434\t      - '0.063'\n435\t    - - Empirical\n436\t      - —\n437\t      - '0.21'\n438\t      - ~0.10\n439\t    - - Full Block\n440\t      - '1.0'\n441\t      - —\n442\t      - '0.178'\n443\t  figures_description:\n444\t  - per-instance error correlation heatmap（instances按T排序）\n445\t  - oracle advantage vs correlation strength连续曲线，标注empirical operating point\n446\t  analysis: 'Empirical correlation (ρ≈0.21) 介于iid和full-block之间。Oracle advantage的realistic\n447\t    估计约10pp（在iid的6.3%和block的17.8%之间插值）。论文需要用empirical ρ重新计算 oracle curves而非only展示两个极端。这使Claim\n448\t    3的贡献更nuanced但也更honest—— \"per-test advantage exists but is closer to the conservative\n449\t    iid estimate than the optimistic block-correlated estimate.\"\n450\t\n451\t    '\n452\t- name: SWE-bench PerTest Data Construction\n453\t  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n454\t  description: Docker环境re-evaluation提取per-test labels，构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集\n455\t  expected_results:\n456\t    total_instances_attempted: 500\n457\t    successful_evaluations: 438\n458\t    docker_failures: 62\n459\t    candidates_per_instance: 16\n460\t    total_samples: 7008\n461\t    avg_tests_per_instance: 12.4\n462\t    median_tests_per_instance: 6\n463\t    f2p_tests_per_instance_mean: 3.0\n464\t    p2p_tests_per_instance_mean: 9.4\n465\t    regression_rate_p2p: 0.013\n466\t    avg_code_length_tokens: 2800\n467\t    avg_test_length_tokens: 450\n468\t    construction_time_hours: 20\n469\t  result_rationale: '500 instances x 16 candidates中，Docker环境构建失败率约12.4%（62/500）——\n470\t    SWE-bench Verified的Docker配置并非100%可复现，部分老repo依赖的package版本 在2026年已broken。成功的438\n471\t    instances产生7008个(code, test_suite, candidate)组合。 每个instance平均12.4个tests（median\n472\t    6，右偏），其中F2P平均3个、P2P平均9.4个。 P2P regression rate仅1.3%，与已完成的p2p-regression-rate实验一致（conclusion:\n473\t    negative）， 说明P2P维度信息量有限。Code长度（~2800 tokens）远超function-level（<200 tokens）， 这是repo-level\n474\t    experiments面临的核心挑战。构建耗时~20h with 16 parallel containers。\n475\t\n476\t    '\n477\t  tables:\n478\t  - name: 'Table 10: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics'\n479\t    columns:\n480\t    - Statistic\n481\t    - Value\n482\t    rows:\n483\t    - - Instances (successful)\n484\t      - '438'\n485\t    - - Candidates per instance\n486\t      - '16'\n487\t    - - Total (code, test) samples\n488\t      - ~54K\n489\t    - - Avg tests/instance\n490\t      - '12.4'\n491\t    - - Avg F2P tests\n492\t      - '3.0'\n493\t    - - Avg P2P tests\n494\t      - '9.4'\n495\t    - - P2P regression rate\n496\t      - 1.3%\n497\t    - - Avg code tokens\n498\t      - '2800'\n499\t  figures_description:\n500\t  - test count per instance分布直方图（F2P / P2P分开）\n501\t  - code length分布直方图，与function-level对比\n502\t  analysis: '数据集构建成功但Docker失败率12.4%略高于预期。438个成功instances足够支撑repo-level实验。 P2P regression\n503\t    rate 1.3%确认了此前negative finding——P2P tests在当前benchmarks上 信息量极低。数据集本身是一个resource\n504\t    contribution，但需要注意438 instances中 68.7% T=1的F2P分布限制了per-test advantage的展示空间。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t- name: Repo-Level Training and Evaluation\n508\t  plan_id: repo-level-training\n509\t  description: 在SWE-bench-PerTest上fine-tune CLS和CWM，评估repo-level性能差异\n510\t  expected_results:\n511\t    cls_4b_repo_pass_f1: 74.8\n512\t    cls_4b_repo_fail_f1: 76.2\n513\t    cls_4b_repo_acc: 75.5\n514\t    cwm_4b_repo_pass_f1: 72.1\n515\t    cwm_4b_repo_fail_f1: 73.8\n516\t    cwm_4b_repo_acc: 73.0\n517\t    repo_level_gap_pp: 2.5\n518\t    cwm_repo_unparseable_pct: 8.7\n519\t    cwm_repo_truncated_pct: 3.2\n520\t    cwm_repo_unparseable_or_truncated_total: 11.9\n521\t    cls_8b_repo_acc: 78.3\n522\t    cwm_8b_repo_acc: 75.9\n523\t    repo_level_gap_8b_pp: 2.4\n524\t    training_instances: 350\n525\t    eval_instances: 88\n526\t  result_rationale: 'Median档核心预测：repo-level CLS F1在[72,80]，CWM F1在[68,77]，gap在[2,5]pp。\n527\t    CWM在repo-level暴露两大failure mode：(1) unparseable 8.7%——repo-level execution output\n528\t    格式多样（tracebacks, assertion messages, log outputs），CWM生成的output经常与 ground truth在formatting上不匹配导致exact\n529\t    match失败；(2) truncated 3.2%—— 部分test的execution output超过model max output tokens（4096），generation被截断。\n530\t    CLS完全不受这两个问题影响因为输出固定为单token。 2.5pp的gap是\"modest advantage\"——方向一致且可解释（CWM failure\n531\t    modes documented）， 但在88个eval instances上可能不显著（需要bootstrap CI）。 8B模型上gap持续（2.4pp），说明failure\n532\t    modes不是纯capacity问题而是formulation inherent。 这是论文能否claim \"complexity-dependent advantage\"\n533\t    的关键实验——2.5pp的gap exist 但need careful statistical reporting。\n534\t\n535\t    '\n536\t  tables:\n537\t  - name: 'Table 11: Repo-Level Results'\n538\t    columns:\n539\t    - Model\n540\t    - Size\n541\t    - Pass F1\n542\t    - Fail F1\n543\t    - Acc\n544\t    - Unparseable%\n545\t    - Truncated%\n546\t    rows:\n547\t    - - CLS\n548\t      - 4B\n549\t      - '74.8'\n550\t      - '76.2'\n551\t      - '75.5'\n552\t      - '0.0'\n553\t      - '0.0'\n554\t    - - CWM\n555\t      - 4B\n556\t      - '72.1'\n557\t      - '73.8'\n558\t      - '73.0'\n559\t      - '8.7'\n560\t      - '3.2'\n561\t    - - CLS\n562\t      - 8B\n563\t      - '77.5'\n564\t      - '79.1'\n565\t      - '78.3'\n566\t      - '0.0'\n567\t      - '0.0'\n568\t    - - CWM\n569\t      - 8B\n570\t      - '75.2'\n571\t      - '76.7'\n572\t      - '75.9'\n573\t      - '5.8'\n574\t      - '2.1'\n575\t    - name: 'Table 12: Function-Level vs Repo-Level Gap'\n576\t      columns:\n577\t      - Level\n578\t      - CLS Acc\n579\t      - CWM Acc\n580\t      - Gap\n581\t      rows:\n582\t      - - Function\n583\t        - '87.4'\n584\t        - '87.4'\n585\t        - '0.0'\n586\t      - - Repo\n587\t        - '75.5'\n588\t        - '73.0'\n589\t        - '2.5'\n590\t  figures_description:\n591\t  - function-level vs repo-level的CLS/CWM paired bar chart，可视化complexity-dependent\n592\t    gap\n593\t  - CWM failure mode breakdown pie chart（correct / unparseable / truncated / wrong\n594\t    prediction）\n595\t  - 'repo-level per-instance accuracy scatter: CLS vs CWM，标注CWM failure instances'\n596\t  analysis: 'Repo-level gap 2.5pp存在但modest。CWM failure modes（11.9% unparseable+truncated）\n597\t    是gap的主要来源——如果exclude这些cases，剩余instances上CLS vs CWM差异进一步缩小。 这支持\"advantage comes\n598\t    from robustness to output complexity\"但effect size小于initial hopes。 论文需要carefully\n599\t    frame：不是\"classification远优于generation\"而是\"classification更robust， advantage grows\n600\t    with complexity but the median SWE-bench instance doesn''t push the threshold\n601\t    hard enough for a large gap\"。配合efficiency argument（1 token vs N tokens）仍有compelling\n602\t    story。\n603\t\n604\t    '\n605\t- name: LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\n606\t  plan_id: llm-judge-baseline\n607\t  description: Qwen3-8B/32B zero-shot作为trajectory-level和per-test judge baseline\n608\t  expected_results:\n609\t    qwen_8b_traj_acc: 64.2\n610\t    qwen_8b_pertest_acc: 61.8\n611\t    qwen_32b_traj_acc: 71.5\n612\t    qwen_32b_pertest_acc: 68.3\n613\t    qwen_8b_pertest_unparseable: 4.8\n614\t    qwen_32b_pertest_unparseable: 2.1\n615\t    finetuned_4b_pertest_acc: 75.5\n616\t    finetuned_advantage_vs_32b_zeroshot: 7.2\n617\t  result_rationale: 'Zero-shot LLM judges在repo-level上表现显著弱于fine-tuned小模型—— 这是因为pass/fail\n618\t    prediction需要precise code semantic理解而非general reasoning。 32B zero-shot (71.5%)\n619\t    仍低于fine-tuned 4B (75.5%)，证明task-specific fine-tuning 的价值。Per-test accuracy低于trajectory-level是因为per-test需要更fine-grained判断，\n620\t    zero-shot模型在没有见过per-test format的情况下表现更差。 Unparseable rates（4.8%/2.1%）来自zero-shot\n621\t    output format不稳定。 这些baselines在Pareto frontier图中提供重要参考点：accuracy vs inference cost曲线上，\n622\t    fine-tuned 4B CLS位于左上角（高accuracy, 低cost），32B zero-shot位于右下（中accuracy, 高cost）。\n623\t\n624\t    '\n625\t  tables:\n626\t  - name: 'Table 13: LLM-as-Judge Baselines (Repo-Level)'\n627\t    columns:\n628\t    - Model\n629\t    - Mode\n630\t    - Accuracy\n631\t    - Unparseable%\n632\t    - Cost (rel)\n633\t    rows:\n634\t    - - Qwen3-8B ZS\n635\t      - Traj\n636\t      - '64.2'\n637\t      - —\n638\t      - 1x\n639\t    - - Qwen3-8B ZS\n640\t      - Per-test\n641\t      - '61.8'\n642\t      - '4.8'\n643\t      - 1x\n644\t    - - Qwen3-32B ZS\n645\t      - Traj\n646\t      - '71.5'\n647\t      - —\n648\t      - 4x\n649\t    - - Qwen3-32B ZS\n650\t      - Per-test\n651\t      - '68.3'\n652\t      - '2.1'\n653\t      - 4x\n654\t    - - Qwen3-4B FT\n655\t      - Per-test CLS\n656\t      - '75.5'\n657\t      - '0.0'\n658\t      - 0.5x\n659\t  figures_description:\n660\t  - 'Pareto frontier: accuracy vs inference cost，标注所有model configurations'\n661\t  analysis: 'Fine-tuned 4B dominates 32B zero-shot on both accuracy AND cost—— 这是论文efficiency\n662\t    narrative的强支持。Pareto frontier清晰展示fine-tuned classification 是当前最优cost-accuracy\n663\t    tradeoff。但需注意zero-shot baselines没有经过prompt engineering 优化，sophisticated prompting可能缩小gap。\n664\t\n665\t    '\n666\t- name: Per-Test Majority Voting\n667\t  plan_id: per-test-majority-voting\n668\t  description: K=3 majority voting for per-test classification\n669\t  expected_results:\n670\t    single_pass_f1: 87.0\n671\t    majority_k3_pass_f1: 88.4\n672\t    single_fail_f1: 87.8\n673\t    majority_k3_fail_f1: 89.1\n674\t    accuracy_gain_pp: 1.2\n675\t    inference_cost_multiplier: 3\n676\t  result_rationale: 'Majority voting (K=3)通过self-consistency提供小幅提升（~1.2pp）。 在function-level上，模型的prediction已经较confident（87%+\n677\t    F1）， 大部分predictions在3次run中一致——improvement来自边界case的tiebreaking。 1.2pp gain with\n678\t    3x cost在Pareto frontier上可能不如直接用更大模型cost-effective。 这个实验主要是completeness——展示test-time\n679\t    compute scaling在per-test上可以工作但 边际收益递减快。对于median档论文可能放到appendix。\n680\t\n681\t    '\n682\t  tables:\n683\t  - name: 'Table A1: Majority Voting Results (Function-Level)'\n684\t    columns:\n685\t    - Method\n686\t    - Pass F1\n687\t    - Fail F1\n688\t    - Acc\n689\t    - Cost\n690\t    rows:\n691\t    - - Single (K=1)\n692\t      - '87.0'\n693\t      - '87.8'\n694\t      - '87.4'\n695\t      - 1x\n696\t    - - Majority (K=3)\n697\t      - '88.4'\n698\t      - '89.1'\n699\t      - '88.7'\n700\t      - 3x\n701\t  figures_description:\n702\t  - accuracy vs K curve (K=1,3,5), diminishing returns可视化\n703\t  analysis: Majority voting提供modest gains，不足以改变论文main narrative。 可作为appendix展示test-time\n704\t    compute scaling dim，或在Pareto frontier中 提供additional data point。不建议作为main contribution。\n705\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24fa57f8-eb28-47f7-a69c-9d723ed470f6","uuid":"9a82874c-b8bd-4722-9ea7-03334ee5f4d2","timestamp":"2026-05-16T07:54:25.456Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260511T231719/median/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: median\nnarrative_guidance: 'Median档下论文核心叙事：function-level null result跨seed稳健复现，classification与CWM在简单任务上统计不可分；\n  repo-level出现方向性优势（2-5pp）但置信区间宽，CWM在repo-level暴露5-14%不可解析/截断率； diagnostic re-repair呈方向性改善但未达显著性阈值。论文重心转向Claim\n  1（efficiency-equivalent + complexity-dependent advantage假说） 和Claim 3（oracle frontier\n  characterization）的组合贡献，Claim 2降格为\"motivated hypothesis with directional evidence\"。\n  目标EMNLP Findings，Main需要强rebuttal prep。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Multi-Seed Core Validation\n  plan_id: multi-seed-core\n  description: Classification和CWM各跑seeds {0, 1, 42}，报告mean±std F1，paired bootstrap\n    CI\n  expected_results:\n    cls_pass_f1_mean: 87.0\n    cls_pass_f1_std: 0.45\n    cls_fail_f1_mean: 87.8\n    cls_fail_f1_std: 0.52\n    cwm_pass_f1_mean: 87.2\n    cwm_pass_f1_std: 0.61\n    cwm_fail_f1_mean: 87.6\n    cwm_fail_f1_std: 0.58\n    mean_f1_diff_cls_minus_cwm: -0.1\n    paired_bootstrap_95ci:\n    - -0.9\n    - 0.7\n    p_value_paired_test: 0.72\n    significant_at_005: false\n  result_rationale: 'Seed 42的已有结果（CLS 87.1/87.9 vs CWM 87.31/87.71）已示null result。\n    Median档下function-level diff在[-0.5, 0.5]pp范围，multi-seed std在0.3-1.0。 4B LoRA在HumanEval/MBPP这类简单function-level数据上variance主要来自LoRA初始化和数据shuffle顺序，\n    因为task本身较简单（短执行输出，binary label明确），不同seed间波动有限但非零。 CWM的std略高于CLS因为generation任务对初始化更敏感（需要学习exact\n    string matching而非binary boundary）。 Bootstrap CI跨零说明无法拒绝H0，正式确认function-level null\n    result。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Multi-Seed Function-Level Results'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Seed\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    - Overall Acc\n    rows:\n    - - CLS\n      - '0'\n      - '86.5'\n      - '87.3'\n      - '86.9'\n    - - CLS\n      - '1'\n      - '87.4'\n      - '88.2'\n      - '87.8'\n    - - CLS\n      - '42'\n      - '87.1'\n      - '87.9'\n      - '87.5'\n    - - CLS\n      - Mean±Std\n      - 87.0±0.45\n      - 87.8±0.52\n      - 87.4±0.46\n    - - CWM\n      - '0'\n      - '87.8'\n      - '88.1'\n      - '87.9'\n    - - CWM\n      - '1'\n      - '86.6'\n      - '87.0'\n      - '86.8'\n    - - CWM\n      - '42'\n      - '87.3'\n      - '87.7'\n      - '87.5'\n    - - CWM\n      - Mean±Std\n      - 87.2±0.61\n      - 87.6±0.58\n      - 87.4±0.56\n  figures_description:\n  - paired bootstrap差值分布直方图，95%CI跨零，标注p=0.72\n  analysis: 'Null result跨三个seed稳健复现。两种formulation在function-level统计不可分（p=0.72）， CI覆盖零。这确认function-level\n    task的简单性使得classification和generation等价—— 短执行输出不触发CWM failure modes。该结果为complexity-dependent\n    advantage叙事提供必要的baseline锚点。 CWM略高std符合预期：generation target空间更大，对随机初始化更敏感。\n\n    '\n- name: Trace-then-Judge Ablation\n  plan_id: trace-then-judge\n  description: 单模型先生成~50 token执行推理trace再输出pass/fail，测试显式推理是否有帮助\n  expected_results:\n    ttj_pass_f1: 87.5\n    ttj_fail_f1: 88.1\n    ttj_overall_acc: 87.8\n    ttj_vs_direct_cls_f1_diff: 0.15\n    ttj_unparseable_pct: 1.2\n    ttj_avg_output_tokens: 58\n    ttj_training_loss: 0.271\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下trace-then-judge与direct CLS的diff在[-2, 2]pp范围。在function-level上，\n    pass/fail判断所需的\"推理\"本质上很浅——输入代码通常<50行，test assertion直接明了。 额外的reasoning trace更多是\"复述\"而非\"深度推理\"，对4B模型而言增加了学习负担但也提供了\n    中间监督信号，两个效应大致抵消。结果略微正向（+0.15pp）但远不显著，说明在simple tasks上 显式推理既不帮助也不伤害。1.2%的unparseable来自偶尔的trace过长导致pass/fail\n    token被截断。 该结果支持论文论点：classification的优势不是来自\"跳过推理\"而是来自\"避免output complexity\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Trace-then-Judge Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    - Acc\n    - Unparseable%\n    rows:\n    - - Direct CLS\n      - '87.0'\n      - '87.8'\n      - '87.4'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - Trace-then-Judge\n      - '87.5'\n      - '88.1'\n      - '87.8'\n      - '1.2'\n    - - CWM (generation)\n      - '87.2'\n      - '87.6'\n      - '87.4'\n      - '0.0'\n  figures_description:\n  - 三种formulation（direct CLS / trace-then-judge / CWM）的F1 bar chart with error bars\n  analysis: 'Trace-then-judge与direct CLS差异微乎其微（+0.15pp），且低于multi-seed variance。 这排除了\"classification优势来自跳过执行推理\"的反驳——即使显式添加reasoning\n    trace也不改变结果。 真正的区分因素是output format complexity（binary vs full string），不是reasoning\n    depth。 1.2% unparseable率虽小但预示了repo-level上chain-of-thought+判断管线可能面临的格式问题。\n\n    '\n- name: Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\n  plan_id: traj-level-finetuned\n  description: Qwen3-4B LoRA训练trajectory-level resolved/unresolved预测，隔离granularity效应\n  expected_results:\n    traj_accuracy: 83.2\n    traj_resolved_f1: 82.8\n    traj_unresolved_f1: 83.5\n    traj_vs_pertest_cls_acc_gap: 4.2\n    instances_evaluated: 1890\n    training_loss: 0.312\n  result_rationale: 'Trajectory-level任务将所有test concatenate成单个输入，要求模型判断\"整体是否resolved\"。\n    这比per-test classification更难：(1) 输入更长（多个test拼接），注意力被稀释； (2) resolved需要ALL tests\n    pass，unresolved只需ANY test fail——正负类的判断逻辑不对称； (3) 数据量不变但每个problem_id只产生1个训练样本（vs\n    per-test产生T个），有效训练集缩小。 Median档下4.2pp的gap合理——trajectory-level不是catastrophically差但明显弱于per-test。\n    这为Claim 2的granularity论点提供function-level证据（per-test > trajectory）， 但因为这是function-level数据，gap主要来自信息论优势而非complexity\n    advantage。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Granularity Comparison (Function-Level)'\n    columns:\n    - Granularity\n    - Accuracy\n    - Positive F1\n    - Negative F1\n    rows:\n    - - Per-test CLS\n      - '87.4'\n      - '87.0'\n      - '87.8'\n    - - Trajectory-level\n      - '83.2'\n      - '82.8'\n      - '83.5'\n    - - Δ\n      - '+4.2'\n      - '+4.2'\n      - '+4.3'\n  figures_description:\n  - per-test vs trajectory-level accuracy随instance test数量T的变化曲线\n  analysis: 'Per-test classification比trajectory-level高4.2pp，确认粒度细化本身有价值。 但需注意这个gap部分来自有效训练样本量差异（per-test产生~6x更多样本），\n    不完全是granularity的信息论优势。论文需要honest reporting这一confound。 该结果为diagnostic signal叙事提供support——per-test\n    predictions的精度高于trajectory-level。\n\n    '\n- name: Model Size Scaling (4B→8B)\n  plan_id: model-size-scaling\n  description: CLS和CWM各从4B扩展到8B，测试classification advantage是否跨scale成立\n  expected_results:\n    cls_8b_pass_f1: 89.2\n    cls_8b_fail_f1: 90.0\n    cls_8b_acc: 89.6\n    cwm_8b_pass_f1: 89.0\n    cwm_8b_fail_f1: 89.8\n    cwm_8b_acc: 89.4\n    cls_4b_to_8b_gain: 2.2\n    cwm_4b_to_8b_gain: 2.0\n    cls_vs_cwm_8b_diff: 0.2\n    cwm_8b_unparseable: 0\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下function-level的CLS vs CWM diff在[-0.5, 0.5]。8B模型在function-level上\n    两种formulation都有~2pp提升（更大模型更好地理解code semantics），但diff依然近零（0.2pp）。 这是因为function-level的execution\n    output足够短（<50 tokens），8B CWM有更多capacity 来精确匹配输出字符串。Null result在8B上持续成立，进一步支持\"advantage\n    is complexity-dependent not scale-dependent\"。CWM 8B unparseable仍为0因为function-level输出格式简单。\n    这个结果关键在于排除\"classification只在小模型上好\"的反驳。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Model Scale Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Size\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    - Acc\n    - Δ vs CLS\n    rows:\n    - - CLS\n      - 4B\n      - '87.0'\n      - '87.8'\n      - '87.4'\n      - —\n    - - CWM\n      - 4B\n      - '87.2'\n      - '87.6'\n      - '87.4'\n      - '-0.0'\n    - - CLS\n      - 8B\n      - '89.2'\n      - '90.0'\n      - '89.6'\n      - —\n    - - CWM\n      - 8B\n      - '89.0'\n      - '89.8'\n      - '89.4'\n      - '-0.2'\n  figures_description:\n  - 4B/8B x CLS/CWM的2x2 F1 line plot，可视化scaling behavior\n  analysis: '两种formulation在function-level上scale equally well（~2pp gain from 4B→8B），\n    diff在8B时仍不显著。结合repo-level实验的预期结果（CLS优势出现）， 可构建\"advantage threshold depends on\n    output complexity not model scale\"的论点。 8B结果也提供了Pareto frontier的additional data\n    points。\n\n    '\n- name: Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\n  plan_id: diagnostic-rerepair\n  description: 对200个instance比较有/无per-test failure信息的repair resolve rate\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_resolve_rate: 31.5\n    with_diagnostic_resolve_rate: 33.0\n    resolve_rate_gain_pp: 1.5\n    n_instances: 200\n    p_value_mcnemar: 0.18\n    significant_at_005: false\n    instances_where_diagnostic_helped: 12\n    instances_where_diagnostic_hurt: 9\n    net_helped: 3\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下re-repair gain在[0.5, 3]pp，方向正确但不显著。原因： (1) Per-test predictions本身有~13%错误率，错误的diagnostic\n    signal可能误导repair agent； (2) 200 instances样本量下1.5pp差异的statistical power很低（需要~800+\n    instances达80% power）； (3) function-level训练的verifier对repo-level数据的transfer有gap，\n    diagnostic signal质量比oracle scenario差很多； (4) repair agent（SWE-agent类）本身的stochasticity也增加noise。\n    net_helped仅3个instance（12帮助-9伤害），说明diagnostic signal的precision不够高 导致部分case被误导。这支持将Claim\n    2降格为hypothesis。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Diagnostic Re-repair Results'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Resolve Rate\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - No diagnostic (baseline)\n      - 31.5%\n      - '[25.1, 38.3]'\n    - - With per-test diagnostic\n      - 33.0%\n      - '[26.5, 39.9]'\n    - - Δ\n      - +1.5pp\n      - '[-0.7, 3.7]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'per-instance paired comparison scatter plot: baseline vs diagnostic-aided resolve'\n  - 帮助/伤害/无影响的instance breakdown bar chart\n  analysis: '方向性正向但p=0.18远不达显著。CI覆盖零。在median档下这是预期结果—— diagnostic signal exists但verifier精度不足以consistently改善downstream\n    repair。 论文应honest报告为\"directional evidence suggesting per-test diagnostics may\n    help targeted re-repair, but our current verifier accuracy is insufficient for\n    statistically significant improvement\"。Claim 2降格为motivated hypothesis。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Test Precision-Recall Analysis\n  plan_id: per-test-precision-recall\n  description: 在完整测试集上测量per-test failure prediction的precision/recall\n  expected_results:\n    fail_precision: 0.876\n    fail_recall: 0.882\n    pass_precision: 0.874\n    pass_recall: 0.868\n    macro_f1: 0.875\n    per_problem_fail_precision_std: 0.12\n    per_problem_fail_recall_std: 0.14\n    hard_subset_fail_f1: 0.78\n    easy_subset_fail_f1: 0.93\n  result_rationale: '这些指标直接来自mvp-b-train已有结果（CLS model precision/recall）。 Median档的新增insight在于per-problem\n    variance分析：fail prediction精度在problems间 差异较大（std~0.12-0.14），说明模型在某些problem types上远好于平均，在另一些上远差。\n    Hard subset（多步逻辑/复杂数据结构）的fail F1降至0.78，easy subset达0.93。 这种heterogeneity解释了为什么aggregate精度看似足够（87.6%），但downstream\n    re-repair 效果不显著——恰好是hard cases最需要diagnostic signal，却也是prediction最不可靠的地方。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Test Prediction Quality'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Overall\n    - Easy Subset\n    - Hard Subset\n    rows:\n    - - Fail Precision\n      - '0.876'\n      - '0.94'\n      - '0.79'\n    - - Fail Recall\n      - '0.882'\n      - '0.92'\n      - '0.77'\n    - - Fail F1\n      - '0.879'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.78'\n    - - Pass F1\n      - '0.871'\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.79'\n  figures_description:\n  - per-problem fail F1分布直方图，标注easy/hard分割\n  - precision-recall curve with operating points标注\n  analysis: 'Aggregate指标掩盖了problem-level heterogeneity。模型在easy cases上precision接近perfect\n    但在hard cases上降至~0.78。这为Claim 3（oracle frontier）提供empirical grounding： per-test\n    advantage在easy cases上不需要（trajectory-level已足够），在hard cases上 又受限于prediction quality。最优operating\n    point取决于difficulty distribution。\n\n    '\n- name: Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\n  plan_id: oracle-f2p-stratified\n  description: 按F2P test数量分层的oracle per-test advantage分析\n  expected_results:\n    T1_pct_instances: 68.7\n    T1_iid_advantage: 0.02\n    T1_block_advantage: 0.109\n    T2_pct_instances: 16.5\n    T2_iid_advantage: 0.185\n    T2_block_advantage: 0.362\n    T3plus_pct_instances: 14.8\n    T3plus_iid_advantage: 0.241\n    T3plus_block_advantage: 0.384\n    weighted_avg_iid_advantage: 0.063\n    weighted_avg_block_advantage: 0.178\n  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench Verified的F2P分布高度右偏（68.7% T=1），T=1时per-test退化为trajectory-level\n    （只有一个test），advantage仅来自于该test的prediction精度差异（near zero under iid， ~11pp under\n    block correlation因为block结构在T=1时等价于instance-level bias）。 T=2时advantage跳增至~18.5pp(iid)/36.2pp(block)，因为两个独立test的joint\n    correct 概率(0.85^2=0.72)远低于trajectory-level的single 0.85，per-test formulation通过\n    分别预测获得的信息增益开始明显。T=3+时advantage继续增长但边际递减。 关键insight：68.7%的instances是T=1，这解释了为什么overall\n    weighted advantage在iid下 仅6.3pp——大部分instances上per-test没有structural advantage。 Block\n    correlation将advantage从6.3pp放大到17.8pp，但这依赖于block假设的empirical validity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Oracle Per-Test Advantage Stratified by F2P Count'\n    columns:\n    - F2P Count\n    - '% Instances'\n    - IID Adv@(70,85)\n    - Block Adv@(70,85)\n    rows:\n    - - T=1\n      - 68.7%\n      - '0.020'\n      - '0.109'\n    - - T=2\n      - 16.5%\n      - '0.185'\n      - '0.362'\n    - - T=3+\n      - 14.8%\n      - '0.241'\n      - '0.384'\n    - - Weighted Avg\n      - 100%\n      - '0.063'\n      - '0.178'\n  figures_description:\n  - per-test advantage vs T的折线图（iid和block两条线），x轴标注各T的instance占比\n  - SWE-bench Verified F2P count分布直方图\n  analysis: '最强standalone finding之一。清晰展示per-test advantage集中在T≥2的31.3% instances。\n    这为practitioners提供决策框架：\"当你知道task有多个failing tests时deploy per-test verifier， 否则trajectory-level足够。\"Weighted\n    average under iid仅6.3pp说明naive deployment 平均收益有限，但targeted deployment（只在T≥2上用）收益显著。\n    Block correlation的放大效应是论文的一个differentiated contribution—— 但需要block-corr-empirical实验来validate假设强度。\n\n    '\n- name: Block Correlation Empirical Validation\n  plan_id: block-corr-empirical\n  description: 从训练好的模型predictions中测量actual error correlation structure\n  expected_results:\n    measured_intra_instance_corr: 0.18\n    simulated_block_corr_assumed: 0.3\n    iid_corr: 0.0\n    partial_block_fraction: 0.62\n    full_block_fraction: 0.15\n    iid_fraction: 0.23\n    effective_rho: 0.21\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下block correlation假设\"部分确认但effect size小于simulated\"。 Oracle\n    simulation假设完全block correlation（ρ=1 within instance），但实际模型的 error correlation受多种因素调制：(1)\n    同一instance内不同tests测试不同功能时errors 较独立；(2) 但共享的code context理解错误导致correlated failures。\n    实测intra-instance correlation ~0.18，介于iid(0)和full-block(1)之间， closer to iid than\n    simulation assumed。这意味着oracle analysis中block curve 过于乐观——实际advantage介于iid和block曲线之间，但更接近iid端。\n    62% of instances show partial correlation, 15% show full block (all tests同时 对或同时错),\n    23% near iid。这部分支持block假设但削弱了它作为论文主要selling point的force。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Empirical Error Correlation Structure'\n    columns:\n    - Correlation Model\n    - Assumed ρ\n    - Measured ρ\n    - Oracle Adv@(70,85)\n    rows:\n    - - IID\n      - '0.0'\n      - —\n      - '0.063'\n    - - Empirical\n      - —\n      - '0.21'\n      - ~0.10\n    - - Full Block\n      - '1.0'\n      - —\n      - '0.178'\n  figures_description:\n  - per-instance error correlation heatmap（instances按T排序）\n  - oracle advantage vs correlation strength连续曲线，标注empirical operating point\n  analysis: 'Empirical correlation (ρ≈0.21) 介于iid和full-block之间。Oracle advantage的realistic\n    估计约10pp（在iid的6.3%和block的17.8%之间插值）。论文需要用empirical ρ重新计算 oracle curves而非only展示两个极端。这使Claim\n    3的贡献更nuanced但也更honest—— \"per-test advantage exists but is closer to the conservative\n    iid estimate than the optimistic block-correlated estimate.\"\n\n    '\n- name: SWE-bench PerTest Data Construction\n  plan_id: swebench-pertest-data\n  description: Docker环境re-evaluation提取per-test labels，构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集\n  expected_results:\n    total_instances_attempted: 500\n    successful_evaluations: 438\n    docker_failures: 62\n    candidates_per_instance: 16\n    total_samples: 7008\n    avg_tests_per_instance: 12.4\n    median_tests_per_instance: 6\n    f2p_tests_per_instance_mean: 3.0\n    p2p_tests_per_instance_mean: 9.4\n    regression_rate_p2p: 0.013\n    avg_code_length_tokens: 2800\n    avg_test_length_tokens: 450\n    construction_time_hours: 20\n  result_rationale: '500 instances x 16 candidates中，Docker环境构建失败率约12.4%（62/500）——\n    SWE-bench Verified的Docker配置并非100%可复现，部分老repo依赖的package版本 在2026年已broken。成功的438\n    instances产生7008个(code, test_suite, candidate)组合。 每个instance平均12.4个tests（median\n    6，右偏），其中F2P平均3个、P2P平均9.4个。 P2P regression rate仅1.3%，与已完成的p2p-regression-rate实验一致（conclusion:\n    negative）， 说明P2P维度信息量有限。Code长度（~2800 tokens）远超function-level（<200 tokens）， 这是repo-level\n    experiments面临的核心挑战。构建耗时~20h with 16 parallel containers。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - Statistic\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Instances (successful)\n      - '438'\n    - - Candidates per instance\n      - '16'\n    - - Total (code, test) samples\n      - ~54K\n    - - Avg tests/instance\n      - '12.4'\n    - - Avg F2P tests\n      - '3.0'\n    - - Avg P2P tests\n      - '9.4'\n    - - P2P regression rate\n      - 1.3%\n    - - Avg code tokens\n      - '2800'\n  figures_description:\n  - test count per instance分布直方图（F2P / P2P分开）\n  - code length分布直方图，与function-level对比\n  analysis: '数据集构建成功但Docker失败率12.4%略高于预期。438个成功instances足够支撑repo-level实验。 P2P regression\n    rate 1.3%确认了此前negative finding——P2P tests在当前benchmarks上 信息量极低。数据集本身是一个resource\n    contribution，但需要注意438 instances中 68.7% T=1的F2P分布限制了per-test advantage的展示空间。\n\n    '\n- name: Repo-Level Training and Evaluation\n  plan_id: repo-level-training\n  description: 在SWE-bench-PerTest上fine-tune CLS和CWM，评估repo-level性能差异\n  expected_results:\n    cls_4b_repo_pass_f1: 74.8\n    cls_4b_repo_fail_f1: 76.2\n    cls_4b_repo_acc: 75.5\n    cwm_4b_repo_pass_f1: 72.1\n    cwm_4b_repo_fail_f1: 73.8\n    cwm_4b_repo_acc: 73.0\n    repo_level_gap_pp: 2.5\n    cwm_repo_unparseable_pct: 8.7\n    cwm_repo_truncated_pct: 3.2\n    cwm_repo_unparseable_or_truncated_total: 11.9\n    cls_8b_repo_acc: 78.3\n    cwm_8b_repo_acc: 75.9\n    repo_level_gap_8b_pp: 2.4\n    training_instances: 350\n    eval_instances: 88\n  result_rationale: 'Median档核心预测：repo-level CLS F1在[72,80]，CWM F1在[68,77]，gap在[2,5]pp。\n    CWM在repo-level暴露两大failure mode：(1) unparseable 8.7%——repo-level execution output\n    格式多样（tracebacks, assertion messages, log outputs），CWM生成的output经常与 ground truth在formatting上不匹配导致exact\n    match失败；(2) truncated 3.2%—— 部分test的execution output超过model max output tokens（4096），generation被截断。\n    CLS完全不受这两个问题影响因为输出固定为单token。 2.5pp的gap是\"modest advantage\"——方向一致且可解释（CWM failure\n    modes documented）， 但在88个eval instances上可能不显著（需要bootstrap CI）。 8B模型上gap持续（2.4pp），说明failure\n    modes不是纯capacity问题而是formulation inherent。 这是论文能否claim \"complexity-dependent advantage\"\n    的关键实验——2.5pp的gap exist 但need careful statistical reporting。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Repo-Level Results'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Size\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    - Acc\n    - Unparseable%\n    - Truncated%\n    rows:\n    - - CLS\n      - 4B\n      - '74.8'\n      - '76.2'\n      - '75.5'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - CWM\n      - 4B\n      - '72.1'\n      - '73.8'\n      - '73.0'\n      - '8.7'\n      - '3.2'\n    - - CLS\n      - 8B\n      - '77.5'\n      - '79.1'\n      - '78.3'\n      - '0.0'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - CWM\n      - 8B\n      - '75.2'\n      - '76.7'\n      - '75.9'\n      - '5.8'\n      - '2.1'\n    - name: 'Table 12: Function-Level vs Repo-Level Gap'\n      columns:\n      - Level\n      - CLS Acc\n      - CWM Acc\n      - Gap\n      rows:\n      - - Function\n        - '87.4'\n        - '87.4'\n        - '0.0'\n      - - Repo\n        - '75.5'\n        - '73.0'\n        - '2.5'\n  figures_description:\n  - function-level vs repo-level的CLS/CWM paired bar chart，可视化complexity-dependent\n    gap\n  - CWM failure mode breakdown pie chart（correct / unparseable / truncated / wrong\n    prediction）\n  - 'repo-level per-instance accuracy scatter: CLS vs CWM，标注CWM failure instances'\n  analysis: 'Repo-level gap 2.5pp存在但modest。CWM failure modes（11.9% unparseable+truncated）\n    是gap的主要来源——如果exclude这些cases，剩余instances上CLS vs CWM差异进一步缩小。 这支持\"advantage comes\n    from robustness to output complexity\"但effect size小于initial hopes。 论文需要carefully\n    frame：不是\"classification远优于generation\"而是\"classification更robust， advantage grows\n    with complexity but the median SWE-bench instance doesn''t push the threshold\n    hard enough for a large gap\"。配合efficiency argument（1 token vs N tokens）仍有compelling\n    story。\n\n    '\n- name: LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\n  plan_id: llm-judge-baseline\n  description: Qwen3-8B/32B zero-shot作为trajectory-level和per-test judge baseline\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_8b_traj_acc: 64.2\n    qwen_8b_pertest_acc: 61.8\n    qwen_32b_traj_acc: 71.5\n    qwen_32b_pertest_acc: 68.3\n    qwen_8b_pertest_unparseable: 4.8\n    qwen_32b_pertest_unparseable: 2.1\n    finetuned_4b_pertest_acc: 75.5\n    finetuned_advantage_vs_32b_zeroshot: 7.2\n  result_rationale: 'Zero-shot LLM judges在repo-level上表现显著弱于fine-tuned小模型—— 这是因为pass/fail\n    prediction需要precise code semantic理解而非general reasoning。 32B zero-shot (71.5%)\n    仍低于fine-tuned 4B (75.5%)，证明task-specific fine-tuning 的价值。Per-test accuracy低于trajectory-level是因为per-test需要更fine-grained判断，\n    zero-shot模型在没有见过per-test format的情况下表现更差。 Unparseable rates（4.8%/2.1%）来自zero-shot\n    output format不稳定。 这些baselines在Pareto frontier图中提供重要参考点：accuracy vs inference cost曲线上，\n    fine-tuned 4B CLS位于左上角（高accuracy, 低cost），32B zero-shot位于右下（中accuracy, 高cost）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: LLM-as-Judge Baselines (Repo-Level)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Mode\n    - Accuracy\n    - Unparseable%\n    - Cost (rel)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B ZS\n      - Traj\n      - '64.2'\n      - —\n      - 1x\n    - - Qwen3-8B ZS\n      - Per-test\n      - '61.8'\n      - '4.8'\n      - 1x\n    - - Qwen3-32B ZS\n      - Traj\n      - '71.5'\n      - —\n      - 4x\n    - - Qwen3-32B ZS\n      - Per-test\n      - '68.3'\n      - '2.1'\n      - 4x\n    - - Qwen3-4B FT\n      - Per-test CLS\n      - '75.5'\n      - '0.0'\n      - 0.5x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Pareto frontier: accuracy vs inference cost，标注所有model configurations'\n  analysis: 'Fine-tuned 4B dominates 32B zero-shot on both accuracy AND cost—— 这是论文efficiency\n    narrative的强支持。Pareto frontier清晰展示fine-tuned classification 是当前最优cost-accuracy\n    tradeoff。但需注意zero-shot baselines没有经过prompt engineering 优化，sophisticated prompting可能缩小gap。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Test Majority Voting\n  plan_id: per-test-majority-voting\n  description: K=3 majority voting for per-test classification\n  expected_results:\n    single_pass_f1: 87.0\n    majority_k3_pass_f1: 88.4\n    single_fail_f1: 87.8\n    majority_k3_fail_f1: 89.1\n    accuracy_gain_pp: 1.2\n    inference_cost_multiplier: 3\n  result_rationale: 'Majority voting (K=3)通过self-consistency提供小幅提升（~1.2pp）。 在function-level上，模型的prediction已经较confident（87%+\n    F1）， 大部分predictions在3次run中一致——improvement来自边界case的tiebreaking。 1.2pp gain with\n    3x cost在Pareto frontier上可能不如直接用更大模型cost-effective。 这个实验主要是completeness——展示test-time\n    compute scaling在per-test上可以工作但 边际收益递减快。对于median档论文可能放到appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A1: Majority Voting Results (Function-Level)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Pass F1\n    - Fail F1\n    - Acc\n    - Cost\n    rows:\n    - - Single (K=1)\n      - '87.0'\n      - '87.8'\n      - '87.4'\n      - 1x\n    - - Majority (K=3)\n      - '88.4'\n      - '89.1'\n      - '88.7'\n      - 3x\n  figures_description:\n  - accuracy vs K curve (K=1,3,5), diminishing returns可视化\n  analysis: Majority voting提供modest gains，不足以改变论文main narrative。 可作为appendix展示test-time\n    compute scaling dim，或在Pareto frontier中 提供additional data point。不建议作为main contribution。\n","numLines":705,"startLine":1,"totalLines":705}}}
